.env
*_accessKeys.csv

# Runtime and diagnostic state
# NOTE: .claude/agents/, .claude/skills/, .claude/workflows/ are constitutional
#       configuration and are intentionally tracked. Only runtime-generated
#       directories are excluded here.
# graph_compiler.py --from-graph staging + diff report: regenerable, deterministic
# preview/compile output (milestone 2, ticket 3). Non-destructive; not source truth.
docs/tier4_orchestration_state/graph_compile/
# graph_projector.py phase-gate mirror nodes (milestone 2, ticket 4): derived,
# regenerable Tier-4 state projected into any vault. The owned folder skeleton is
# tracked; the generated PGS-*.md mirror nodes are not.
**/18_phase_gate_state/PGS-*.md
.claude/skill_diag/
.claude/semantic_diag/
.claude/runs/
.claude/logs/
.claude/cache/
.claude/benchmark/

